    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys as turrets and place them on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/1f41b77ce4a2a20d62cf3c3b71f4f221.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/1f41b77ce4a2a20d62cf3c3b71f4f221.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/1f41b77ce4a2a20d62cf3c3b71f4f221.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase perks, upgrades, and buy more keys to build your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/3f1ede831ecd935491c267aa897f33db.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/3f1ede831ecd935491c267aa897f33db.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/3f1ede831ecd935491c267aa897f33db.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock perks with the waves earned through playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f9f3310eed10e5cf06470e9c2de0f53d.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f9f3310eed10e5cf06470e9c2de0f53d.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f9f3310eed10e5cf06470e9c2de0f53d.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat every stage in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f5618b38ca65f01c3ab831ba34563692.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f5618b38ca65f01c3ab831ba34563692.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f5618b38ca65f01c3ab831ba34563692.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys as turrets and place them on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/1f41b77ce4a2a20d62cf3c3b71f4f221.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/1f41b77ce4a2a20d62cf3c3b71f4f221.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/1f41b77ce4a2a20d62cf3c3b71f4f221.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase perks, upgrades, and buy more keys to build your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/3f1ede831ecd935491c267aa897f33db.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/3f1ede831ecd935491c267aa897f33db.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/3f1ede831ecd935491c267aa897f33db.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock perks with the waves earned through playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f9f3310eed10e5cf06470e9c2de0f53d.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f9f3310eed10e5cf06470e9c2de0f53d.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f9f3310eed10e5cf06470e9c2de0f53d.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat every stage in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f5618b38ca65f01c3ab831ba34563692.poster.avif?t=1749198770\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f5618b38ca65f01c3ab831ba34563692.webm?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371060/extras/f5618b38ca65f01c3ab831ba34563692.mp4?t=1749198770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
